From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh McKinney <joshka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: template: expose fetched Git refs on commits

Add a commit template method for displaying fetched Git refs so log
output can show refs like refs/pull/123/head@origin directly on the
commits they name.
---
